      "content": "The noise you're hearing is the sound of your own exhaustion, and it's a heavy burden to carry. If the emptiness feels permanent, it might be time to explore what's underneath this feeling of pointlessness. Speaking with a therapist or counselor can provide a safe space to unpack these overwhelming thoughts and find ways to manage the internal noise. There are people who can help you navigate this feeling of being stuck.",
      "source": "target",
